Sierra Firmware Upgrade:
----------------------------------------------

1. 
>> Copy attached contents to sdcard 
>> untar the Sierra.tar.bz2 to /home/ubuntu/Sierra (tar -jxvf Sierra.tar.bz2)
>> cd to /home/ubuntu/Sierra

2. chmod 777 ./ -R

3. Pls ensure wifi is turned off
>>   sudo nmcli radio wifi off

>>   Ensure wlan0 is off by checking ifconfig.

4. sudo ./fwdldarm -s /home/ubuntu/Sierra/slqssdk -d 9x15 -p /home/ubuntu/Sierra/TEMP

This is flashing Sierra AT&T firmware using their sample executable.

If flashing is success , then should see message like below , the download time should not be more than 3-5 mins. Firmware download of Sierra module 
is required only once.
